          "type": "text",
          "content": "Helix Biotech — Q1 2025 Operations Report",
          "heading": 1,
          "style": "h1",
          "tocEntry": "Helix Biotech — Q1 2025 Operations Report",
          "tocLevel": 1,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d16-s1",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "1. Executive Summary",
          "heading": 2,
          "style": "h2",
          "tocEntry": "1. Executive Summary",
          "tocLevel": 2,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 29.5
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d16-s1-p0",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "This report summarises Helix Biotech's operating performance for Q1 2025. The business operates in laboratory automation, and the quarter was shaped by record retention and slower hiring. Figures are unaudited and reflect management accounts as of quarter close.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 43.9
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d16-s1-owner",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "The Notifications platform is owned by the Trust & Safety team; its on-call lead for the quarter is Sena Yıldız, who also chairs the weekly reliability review.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 74.2
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d16-s1-p1",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Detailed departmental commentary is available in the appendix distributed to budget owners.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 98.4
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d16-s2",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "2. Regional Performance",
          "heading": 2,
          "style": "h2",
          "tocEntry": "2. Regional Performance",
          "tocLevel": 2,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 116.3
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d16-s2-p2",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "The table below breaks down performance by sales region. Growth is measured against the prior quarter in constant currency, and churn counts customers who did not renew during the period.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 130.7
          },
          "width": 166
        }
      ]
    },
