        {
          "id": "d16-s8-outlook",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "For Q2 2025 the plan assumes stable churn and a step-up in enterprise pipeline. The board approved a capital expenditure budget of $15.0M for Q2 2025, weighted towards edge infrastructure.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 97.4
